# Generated at build time from the GitHub API: contributor photographs and
# each person's commit count. Deliberately not committed. It is personal data,
# the repository is public, and the snapshot carries a timestamp, so every
# build rewrote it and every build rewrote the images next to it. The build
# regenerates both before packaging; a build with no network and nothing on
# disk writes an empty snapshot locally and fails in CI, so a release can
# never ship an empty About screen silently.
src/about/credits.snapshot.json
renderer/about/avatars/

# Config and config backups
config.toml
config.toml.backup-*
version.toml